Redefining the experience of luxury, one exquisite detail at a time. RAY by House of Aurya opens its doors in Bengaluru as a distinctive destination where natural diamonds, fine jewellery, art and craftsmanship come together. Envisioned as a mansion-style space, it brings a new dimension to luxury through curated experiences, personalised hospitality and exclusive gatherings. Founded by Shikha Dadha, co-founded by Saad Salman, and with Reetesh Gade as Chief Marketing Officer, RAY reflects a vision that goes beyond traditional jewellery retail. The grand opening saw the presence of Dia Mirza, Shriya Saran, Nikki Galrani and Aadi Pinisetty, marking the arrival of a destination that goes beyond jewellery to celebrate the art of living.

